Package: cpnrisktool
Title: Crop Disease and Insect Risk Tool
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: R Shiny app for agricultural weather monitoring and crop
    disease risk forecasting. Not an installable package; this file lists
    dependencies so CI can install them (local and deploy use renv.lock).
